# Informal Specification

- User-facing `.aspec` is Markdown-like with fixed H1: Functions, Data Resources, Constraints.
- Document metadata lives in `.agile-sofl/informal-meta.json`, never YAML frontmatter in the user file.
- Mutate `InformalSpecification` (or patches); serialize to Markdown. Do not treat YAML as the primary format.
- Node identity is derived from type + title (`fn-login`). Do not write `<!-- @id:... -->` into user-facing markdown.
- YAML `.aspec` remains parse-compatible for legacy fixtures only.
